<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33752" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">părā^clētus</span></b> 
		(ĕ scanned short, <i><span class="en">Prud. Cath. 5,
		160</span></i>; id. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεφ</span>. 10, 430) or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">părā^clī-tus</span></b>  (ĭ
		scanned short, <i><span class="en">Prud. Perieg. 2622</span></i>),
			i, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράκλητος</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>An advocate</i>, <i>defender</i>, <i>helper</i>, <i>protector</i>, <i>comforter</i>, <i><span class="en">Tert. Verg.
				Vel. 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Anim. 55</span></i>; Res.
			Carn. f.: <i><span class="en">Vulg. Johan. 14, 16</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">15, 26</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>One of the œons of Valentinian</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Tert. adv. Val. 8</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
